{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Peter [F/C]walked through the [C]night [F/C]
[C]To [F/C]the home [C]of Ma[F/C]ry
[C]Many had [F/C]gathered [Am7]there
To [F/G]pray without ceas[C][F/C]ing [C][F/C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]He knocked on the [F/C]outer [C]door [F/C]
[C]A servant [F/C]girl [C]came [F/C]
