[Am7]She heard his [G]voice clear [C][F/C][C][F/C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]She was [F]overjo[C]yed
[Am]She did not [F]open the [C]gate
She ran in[F]side quickly
[Am]To tell them [G]all true [C][F/C][C][F/C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C]Peter was [F]standing out[C]side
[Am7]The gate remained [F]shut [C]
The joy was [F]too great
To [Am7]stop at the [G]door
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
[Am]Mary's [F]house was the [C]place
Where [F]prayer [G]did not [C]end
{end_of_verse}
